# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The build takes NOTHING from the context: the image git-clones this
# repository at its release tag (submodules included), so the context only
# needs to be small. Ignore all of it.
#
# What lands in the image is decided by the clone, not by this file — including
# the Dockerfile itself, which the security canary
# `API/Environment/tests/1.3-docker-context-secrets` looks for to know it is
# running inside a built image.
